  "t_m": {
   "x": 1760,
   "y": 7940,
   "text": "Share and invite: how clubs market for us.",
   "kind": "title1",
   "maxW": 2380,
   "page": "r1"
  },
  "s_a": {
   "x": 3750,
   "y": 1800,
   "w": 360,
   "fill": "gray",
   "text": "Good for: the president's setup; one place for everything.\n\nCosts: a new place to find (a \"Your club\" item in the nav), apart from where officers talk.\n\nSize: medium.",
   "page": "r1"
  },
  "s_b": {
   "x": 4220,
   "y": 3400,
   "w": 360,
   "fill": "orange",
   "text": "My pick, with D's event stages on Up next and the share kit.\n\nGood for: daily running; phone officers finally get members, followers and requests (the Club tools sheet).\n\nCosts: setup and numbers are tighter; the public page stays separate.\n\nSize: smallest.",
   "page": "r1"
  },
  "s_c": {
   "x": 3750,
   "y": 5000,
   "w": 360,
   "fill": "gray",
   "text": "Good for: setup and marketing; what officers make is what visitors see. Events tab first.\n\nCosts: running the night (check-in, posting) still means going to Messages.\n\nSize: medium.",
   "page": "r1"
  },
  "s_d": {
   "x": 3750,
   "y": 6600,
   "w": 360,
   "fill": "gray",
   "text": "Good for: event-led clubs; each event shows its next step, from posted to thank-you.\n\nCosts: clubs that mostly talk get less; the biggest build.\n\nSize: largest.",
   "page": "r1"
  },
  "s_m": {
   "x": 4220,
   "y": 8200,
   "w": 360,
   "fill": "gray",
   "text": "Shared by every option.\n\nThe members' link (call 3) and the story cards (call 7) are new: both need your yes. Cards carry no names or faces, and a count shows only from 5 up.",
   "page": "r1"
  },
